      "notes": "Slackware 14.0 (September 2012): kernel 3.2, Xfce 4.10 in its own series, OpenSSH 6.1 (no ed25519 before 6.5, no rsa-sha2 before 7.2: RSA key, legacy SSH options), agetty with --autologin. Born experimental: vmctl check-vms slackware-14.0 runs one."
